---
---

<section class="section black-800">
        <div class="section-gap svc-faq">
          <div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container">
            <div class="section-header left">
              <div class="section-badge">
                <div class="pill-dot"></div>
                <div class="badge-text">COMMON QUESTIONS</div>
              </div>
              <div class="max-width-42 faq-v3">
                <h2 class="section-heading small">A few answers to help you understand how we work, where we can help, and what to expect from an AXIOMET engagement.</h2>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-wrapper">
              <div to-top-0="" class="faq-card v3">
                <div class="faq-left-main v2">
                  <div class="faq-left">
                    <div class="impact-number-wrap">
                      <div class="pill-dot"></div>
                      <div class="font-extra-small">01.</div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-right v3">
                  <div class="faq-card-top v2">
                    <div class="font-normal">What does AXIOMET actually do?</div>
                    <div class="faq-icon-wrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="faq-icon">
                        <path d="M11.9922 4V20M19.9922 12H3.99219" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                      </svg></div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="faq-summary-wrap">
                    <p class="faq-summary">AXIOMET helps technology-driven companies solve complex challenges across strategy, engineering, AI, and intelligent systems—from defining the right direction to building scalable solutions.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div to-top-0="" class="faq-card v3">
                <div class="faq-left-main v2">
                  <div class="faq-left">
                    <div class="impact-number-wrap">
                      <div class="pill-dot"></div>
                      <div class="font-extra-small">02.</div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-right v3">
                  <div class="faq-card-top v2">
                    <div class="font-normal">What types of companies do you work with?</div>
                    <div class="faq-icon-wrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="faq-icon">
                        <path d="M11.9922 4V20M19.9922 12H3.99219" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                      </svg></div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="faq-summary-wrap">
                    <p class="faq-summary">Our services suit founders validating a first product, scale-ups modernising core platforms, and enterprises launching new lines—often in robotics, devices, and SaaS.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div to-top-0="" class="faq-card v3">
                <div class="faq-left-main v2">
                  <div class="faq-left">
                    <div class="impact-number-wrap">
                      <div class="pill-dot"></div>
                      <div class="font-extra-small">03.</div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-right v3">
                  <div class="faq-card-top v2">
                    <div class="font-normal">Can AXIOMET help us if we only have an idea?</div>
                    <div class="faq-icon-wrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="faq-icon">
                        <path d="M11.9922 4V20M19.9922 12H3.99219" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                      </svg></div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="faq-summary-wrap">
                    <p class="faq-summary">Absolutely. Our Product &amp; Innovation service starts with discovery workshops, quick feasibility checks, and a lean prototype plan, so an early idea is tested before major build spend.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div to-top-0="" class="faq-card v3">
                <div class="faq-left-main v2">
                  <div class="faq-left">
                    <div class="impact-number-wrap">
                      <div class="pill-dot"></div>
                      <div class="font-extra-small">04.</div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-right v3">
                  <div class="faq-card-top v2">
                    <div class="font-normal">Do you provide strategy or actual engineering support?</div>
                    <div class="faq-icon-wrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="faq-icon">
                        <path d="M11.9922 4V20M19.9922 12H3.99219" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                      </svg></div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="faq-summary-wrap">
                    <p class="faq-summary">Both. Each service pairs advice with delivery—strategy work ends in a prioritised roadmap, and our engineering team then builds, tests, and launches it with your people.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div to-top-0="" class="faq-card v3">
                <div class="faq-left-main v2">
                  <div class="faq-left">
                    <div class="impact-number-wrap">
                      <div class="pill-dot"></div>
                      <div class="font-extra-small">05.</div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-right v3">
                  <div class="faq-card-top v2">
                    <div class="font-normal">How do you approach a complex technical problem?</div>
                    <div class="faq-icon-wrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="faq-icon">
                        <path d="M11.9922 4V20M19.9922 12H3.99219" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                      </svg></div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="faq-summary-wrap">
                    <p class="faq-summary">Every service begins with a scoped discovery sprint: we audit current systems, rank the key risks, and prove the riskiest assumptions in code before scaling up.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div to-top-0="" class="faq-card v3">
                <div class="faq-left-main v2">
                  <div class="faq-left">
                    <div class="impact-number-wrap">
                      <div class="pill-dot"></div>
                      <div class="font-extra-small">06.</div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-right v3 last">
                  <div class="faq-card-top v2">
                    <div class="font-normal">What makes AXIOMET different from a traditional consultancy?</div>
                    <div class="faq-icon-wrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="faq-icon">
                        <path d="M11.9922 4V20M19.9922 12H3.99219" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                      </svg></div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="faq-summary-wrap">
                    <p class="faq-summary">Our services are run by one senior team that owns outcomes end to end—no subcontracted build, no lost context, and clear success metrics agreed before work begins.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div to-top-0="" class="marque-list-wrap svc-faq">
              <div class="logo-marque-list approach-v3"><img src="/images/Frame-8.webp" loading="lazy" alt="StratoLink logo" class="company-logo"><img src="/images/Frame-10_1Frame-10.webp" loading="lazy" alt="Oculis logo" class="company-logo"><img src="/images/Frame-11_1Frame-11.webp" loading="lazy" alt="BlazeCore logo" class="company-logo"><img src="/images/Frame-12_1Frame-12.webp" loading="lazy" alt="NeuroLink logo" class="company-logo"><img src="/images/Frame-13_1Frame-13.webp" loading="lazy" alt="PixelGrid logo" class="company-logo"><img src="/images/Frame-14_1Frame-14.webp" loading="lazy" alt="LucenAI logo" class="company-logo"><img src="/images/Frame-15_1Frame-15.webp" loading="lazy" alt="Brightly logo" class="company-logo"><img src="/images/Frame-16_1Frame-16.webp" loading="lazy" alt="IntelliSpark logo" class="company-logo"></div>
              <div class="logo-marque-list approach-v3"><img src="/images/Frame-8.webp" loading="lazy" alt="StratoLink logo" class="company-logo"><img src="/images/Frame-10_1Frame-10.webp" loading="lazy" alt="Oculis logo" class="company-logo"><img src="/images/Frame-11_1Frame-11.webp" loading="lazy" alt="BlazeCore logo" class="company-logo"><img src="/images/Frame-12_1Frame-12.webp" loading="lazy" alt="NeuroLink logo" class="company-logo"><img src="/images/Frame-13_1Frame-13.webp" loading="lazy" alt="PixelGrid logo" class="company-logo"><img src="/images/Frame-14_1Frame-14.webp" loading="lazy" alt="LucenAI logo" class="company-logo"><img src="/images/Frame-15_1Frame-15.webp" loading="lazy" alt="Brightly logo" class="company-logo"><img src="/images/Frame-16_1Frame-16.webp" loading="lazy" alt="IntelliSpark logo" class="company-logo"></div>
              <div class="faq-overlay"></div>
              <div class="faq-overlay right"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
